<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Studio | Minimalist Portfolio</title>
    <style>
        /* --- RESET & VARIÁVEIS BASE --- */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        :root {
            --bg-dark: #0a0a0a;
            --bg-light: #f4f4f4;
            --text-dark: #111111;
            --text-light: #ffffff;
            --text-muted: #888888;
            --font-sans: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            --transition: cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
        }

        html, body {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            font-family: var(--font-sans);
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text-light);
            line-height: 1.6;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        /* --- BARRA DE NAVEGAÇÃO --- */
        .navbar {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 2rem 4rem;
            z-index: 1000;
            transition: all 0.5s var(--transition);
        }

        .navbar.scrolled {
            padding: 1.2rem 4rem;
            background: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--text-light);
            cursor: pointer;
            z-index: 1001;
            width: 70px;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
            gap: 2.5rem;
        }

        .nav-btn {
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            font-weight: 400;
            opacity: 0.6;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-family: inherit;
        }

        .nav-btn:hover, 
        .nav-btn.active {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        /* --- MENU HAMBÚRGUER --- */
        .menu-toggle {
            display: none;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            width: 28px;
            height: 18px;
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            z-index: 1001;
        }

        .menu-toggle span {
            width: 100%;
            height: 2px;
            background-color: var(--text-light);
            transition: all 0.4s var(--transition);
        }

        .menu-toggle.active span:nth-child(1) {
            transform: translateY(8px) rotate(45deg);
        }
        .menu-toggle.active span:nth-child(2) {
            opacity: 0;
        }
        .menu-toggle.active span:nth-child(3) {
            transform: translateY(-8px) rotate(-45deg);
        }

        /* --- CONTÊINER PRINCIPAL DE SCROLL --- */
        .main-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100vh;
            overflow-y: auto;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* --- ESTRUTURA DAS SEÇÕES (SEM ERRO DE EMPILHAMENTO 3D) --- */
        section {
            position: relative;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 8rem 10% 6rem 10%;
            background-position: center;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            background-size: cover;
            background-attachment: fixed; /* Efeito Parallax Nativo e Seguro */
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Overlay escuro para garantir legibilidade dos textos sobre imagens */
        section.has-bg::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
            z-index: 1;
        }

        /* Imagens de fundo aplicadas diretamente na seção */
        #home {
            background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80');
        }

        #journal {
            background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486406146926-c627a92ad1ab?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80');
        }

        /* Seções Claras sem Imagem */
        .light-section {
            background-color: var(--bg-light);
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }

        .light-section p {
            color: #555555;
        }

        /* --- CONTEÚDO --- */
        .content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2; /* Garante que o texto fique SEMPRE acima do fundo */
            max-width: 800px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        h1, h2 {
            font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
            font-weight: 300;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            line-height: 1.15;
        }

        p {
            font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.5vw, 1.15rem);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem auto;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        .has-bg p {
            color: #cccccc;
        }

        /* --- PORTFÓLIO & MÍDIA --- */
        .media-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1100px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }

        .media-box {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            height: 350px;
            background: #111;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .media-box img, .media-box video {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform 0.8s var(--transition);
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        .media-box:hover img, .media-box:hover video {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            opacity: 1;
        }

        /* --- CONTATO --- */
        .contact-form {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .form-group input, .form-group textarea {
            width: 100%;
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            padding: 1rem 0;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            font-family: var(--font-sans);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .form-group input:focus, .form-group textarea:focus {
            border-bottom-color: var(--text-dark);
        }

        .submit-btn {
            background: var(--text-dark);
            color: var(--text-light);
            border: none;
            padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .submit-btn:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        /* --- RESPONSIVIDADE --- */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .navbar {
                padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
            }
            .navbar.scrolled {
                padding: 1.2rem 2rem;
            }

            .menu-toggle {
                display: flex;
            }

            .nav-links {
                position: fixed;
                top: 0;
                left: 0;
                width: 100%;
                height: 100vh;
                background-color: var(--bg-dark);
                flex-direction: column;
                justify-content: center;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 2rem;
                opacity: 0;
                pointer-events: none;
                transition: opacity 0.4s var(--transition);
                z-index: 1000;
            }

            .nav-links.active {
                opacity: 1;
                pointer-events: auto;
            }

            .nav-btn {
                font-size: 1.2rem;
                letter-spacing: 3px;
            }

            section {
                padding: 7rem 6% 4rem 6%;
                /* iOS Safari desativa 'fixed', essa linha garante comportamento normal no iPhone */
                background-attachment: scroll;
            }

            .media-container {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 1.5rem;
            }

            .media-box {
                height: 260px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- BARRA DE NAVEGAÇÃO -->
    <nav class="navbar">
     <!--   <span onclick="scrollToSection('home')" class="logo">STUDIO.</span>
       --> <img class="logo"src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/sitesv/AA5AbUCyYnYKv6rFFobUbJI9gF8UipzY9iVPmY2DOeD0jQdSllYannUFiDPSYJshSY_Zl7rndEeOpzVIa6pi_i-LoFUxhBuwk99XKh_WUhcJW8Ypvt_0FNDQjW-j638nWFlq-ooxFttkaiH-AjuwnlrkGWuanbpomW00OPBJ61cxF6KXZdiAPGRXxUOsoZYXskScGN_YjkyuHpO9GhhRbdHFcCMGD537-oi7Uql_3SjdybM=w1280"
         alt="" srcset="">
        
        <button class="menu-toggle" id="menu-toggle" aria-label="Abrir Menu">
            <span></span>
            <span></span>
            <span></span>
        </button>

        <ul class="nav-links" id="nav-links">
            <li><button class="nav-btn active" onclick="scrollToSection('home')">Home</button></li>
            <li><button class="nav-btn" onclick="scrollToSection('about')">Sobre</button></li>
            <li><button class="nav-btn" onclick="scrollToSection('portfolio')">Portfólio</button></li>
            <li><button class="nav-btn" onclick="scrollToSection('services')">Serviços</button></li>
            <li><button class="nav-btn" onclick="scrollToSection('journal')">Journal</button></li>
            <li><button class="nav-btn" onclick="scrollToSection('contact')">Contato</button></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- CONTAINER DE SCROLL PRINCIPAL -->
    <div class="main-wrapper" id="main-wrapper">

        <!-- 1. HOME -->
        <section id="home" class="has-bg">
            <div class="content">
                <h1>Minimalismo &amp; Propósito</h1>
                <p>Criamos experiências digitais sofisticadas voltadas para marcas contemporâneas através de design limpo e direção de arte sob medida.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 2. SOBRE -->
        <section id="about" class="light-section">
            <div class="content">
                <h2>A Estética do Silêncio</h2>
                <p>Acreditamos que o design sofisticado não grita; ele se faz notar pela ausência de excessos. Nosso processo elimina o ruído visual para dar espaço ao que realmente importa.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. PORTFÓLIO -->
        <section id="portfolio">
            <div class="content" style="max-width: 100%;">
                <h2>Projetos Selecionados</h2>
                <p>Concepções visuais, fotografia de produto e interfaces minimalistas.</p>
                
                <div class="media-container">
                    <div class="media-box">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509343256512-d77a5cb3791b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Branding">
                    </div>
                    <div class="media-box">
                        <video autoplay loop muted playsinline>
                            <source src="https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/preview/mixkit-abstract-laser-lights-background-41764-large.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                        </video>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 4. SERVIÇOS -->
        <section id="services" class="light-section">
